## AC3 residual query (SELECT only), SQL from docs/solutions/NEARS-4113 D5:
SELECT o.payment_method AS order_pm, o.order_status, op.payment_method AS row_pm, COUNT(*) AS rows_n, COUNT(DISTINCT op.order_id) AS orders_n FROM order_payments op JOIN orders o ON o.id=op.order_id JOIN offline_payments f ON f.order_id=o.id WHERE op.payment_status='unpaid' AND op.payment_method<>'cash_on_delivery' AND f.status='verified' GROUP BY o.payment_method, o.order_status, op.payment_method;

